{"results":[{"url":"https://www.propertycrow.com/mumbai/propertyview_dlh-kesley-borivali-west_3019.html","title":"DLH Kesley Borivali West Mumbai - Price, Location, Possession, Reviews, Investor Flats, Resale Flats | Property Crow","raw_content":"![PropertyCrow.com](/propertycrow-logo-sm.svg)\n\n1. [New Projects](https://www.propertycrow.com/)\n›2. [New Projects in Mumbai](https://www.propertycrow.com/mumbai/property_residential-projects_1_1_0_0_0.html)\n›3. [New Projects in Borivali West](https://www.propertycrow.com/mumbai/property_new-projects-in-borivali-west_1_1_0_0_26.html)\n›4. [DLH Kesley](https://www.propertycrow.com/mumbai/propertyview_dlh-kesley-borivali-west_3019.html)\n\n![DLH Kesley](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/3019/photo-22262.jpeg)\n\n![DLH Kesley](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/3019/photo-22262.jpeg)\n\n![DLH Kesley](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/3019/photo-22263.jpeg)\n\n![DLH Kesley - typical flr plan](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/3019/photo-22264.jpeg)\n\n![DLH Kesley - typical flr plan](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/3019/photo-22264.jpeg)\n\nby DLH Developers\n\n# DLH Kesley\n\nS V Road, Mulji Nagar, Mumbai\n\nConfig: 2 BHK Apartments\n\nSize 698 Sq.ft To 725 Sq.ft Carpet Area\n\nPrice ₹1.88 Cr Onwards\n\nCall Now +919820575619\n\n**Code:** PropertyCrow3019\n\nPossession Status Possession Expected Around March 2019\n\nRERA P51800002310  \n[View RERA QR Code](#qr)\n\nUnits Available Investor / Resale Units Available\n\nAbout Project\n\n## DLH KESLEY\n\n**DLH Kesley** placed at S V Road, Shastri Nagar, Mulji Nagar, Borivali West, Mumbai is a under construction housing project designed by DLH Developers. Name of this developer is more than sufficient to attract most of the genuine customers in market. The project is conceptualised as a elegant, With a mo\n\ndern experience. Good living enclave with its own life-style and luxury options. DLH Kesley will offer 2 BHK Apartments with starting up are from 698 Sq.ft To 725 Sq.ft Carpet Area. The project is well ready with all the features to implement the specifications of the people.\n\nBorivali West, also known as the ‘suburb of gardens’ is placed on the north-west part and is one of the well- designed places in Mumbai. Placed between Dahisar and Poisar Rivers, Borivali starts from the word ‘bor’ which means lifestyle of lot of bushes and sweet fruits. Populated with various landmarks and visitor spots, it is enclosed by Sanjay Gandhi National Park in the eastern side, which consists of the 4th century historical site Kanheri Caves and mangrove forests in the west.\n\nDLH has been created by one of the most reputed designer having strong position in western suburbs protecting verticals of housing and industrial real estate. DLH is yet an a different landmark housing project satisfying all requirements of modern society at best place in Andheri West.\n\nFor more details you may please contact us.\n\nType, Area & Price\n\n## Price List\n\n| Type | Size | Price |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2 BHK | 698 | 1.88 CR |\n| 2 BHK | 725 | 1.96 CR |\n\n**Note:** Above Mentioned Sizes and Prices are Approximate, Maintenance, Club Charges, Registration, Stamp duty, Car Parking, etc as applicable. **\\*Rates are indicative.**\n\nAmenities\n\n## Project Amenities\n\n**Community Amenities:**  \n\\* Garden  \n\\* 24Hr Backup  \n\\* Security  \n  \n**Kid Friendly:**  \n\\* Play Area  \n  \n**Connectivity:**  \n\\* intercom  \n\\* Wifi  \n\\* Brodband Internet  \n  \n**Green Living:**  \n\\* Rain Water Harvesting  \n  \n**Health & Fitness;**  \n\\* Gymnasium\n\nSpecifications\n\n## Project Specifications\n\n**Structural:**  \n\\* Floor to floor Height of 10.6  \n\\* 6m wide Ramp for easy movement  \n\\* Rainwater Harvesting Tank  \n\\* Grand Lobby with 15ft height  \n  \n**Kitchen / Bathroom:**  \n\\* Brandded Sanitary Fittings  \n\\* Granite Cooking Platform with Stainless Steel Sink  \n\\* Designer Ceramic Tiles in Dado  \n\\* Designer Tiles up to the ceiling in bathrooms  \n  \n**Wall & Floorings:**  \n\\* Vitrified flooring in all rooms  \n\\* Anit-Skid Flooring in bathroom  \n\\* Plastic Paint with POP on all interior walls  \n  \n**Doors & Windows:**  \n\\* Durable Doors with laminates on both the sides  \n\\* Exquisite Anodised Aluminium Sliding  \n\\* Granite Moulded window sills  \n  \n**Electrical Fittings:**  \n\\* Modular Electrical fittings  \n\\* TV & Telephone Points  \n\\* Concealed Copper Wiring  \n\\* Fire sprinklers in all rooms in every flat\n\nFloor Plans\n\n## Floor Plan\n\n![2 BHK Floor Plan](/floor-plan.jpg)\n\n🔒 Submit enquiry to unlock floor plan\n\nRERA Details\n\n## RERA QR Code\n\n![](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/3019/qra_1979.png)\n\n**RERA No:** P51800002310\n\n**Developer:** DLH Developers\n\n**Project:** DLH Kesley\n\n[Verify on MahaRERA Website →](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/)\n\nLocation\n\n## Location & Nearby\n\nMap - S V Road, Mulji Nagar, Mumbai\n\n**Address:** S V Road, Mulji Nagar, Mumbai\n\n**Close To:** Sai Baba Mandir Marg, S V Road & Mahavir Nagar\n\nFAQ\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions about DLH KESLEY\n\nWhere is DLH Kesley Exactly located?\n\nDLH Kesley is located at S V Road, Mulji Nagar, .\n\nIs DLH Kesley Rera Registered?\n\nYes, It is RERA Registered with Rera Number P51800002310. You can verify the details on the official RERA website.\n\nWhat are unit options available in DLH Kesley?\n\nDLH Kesley offers 2 BHK Apartments.\n\nWhat is the starting price of Flats in DLH Kesley?\n\nThe starting price of Flats at DLH Kesley is 1.88 Cr Onwards. Contact us for the latest pricing and offers.\n\nWhen is the Possession of Flats?\n\nThe expected possession date for DLH Kesley is Possession Expected Around March 2019.\n\nWhat are the nearest landmarks?\n\nKey landmarks near DLH Kesley include Samadhan Restaurants & Bar, Borivali Raiwlay Station, Sai Sparsh Health Care, Yes Bank ATM, Himalaya High School & Borivali Police Station.\n\nIs DLH Kesley, approved by 