-west-mumbai-l1493)\n  + [Apartments Flats Sale In Borivali West](https://www.addressofchoice.com/mumbai/borivali-west/apartments-lpt5l1493)\n  + [House/Villas for sale in Borivali West](https://www.addressofchoice.com/mumbai/borivali-west/villas-lpt7l1493)\n  + [Ready to Move Apartments in Borivali West](https://www.addressofchoice.com/mumbai/borivali-west/ready-to-move-lps4l1493)\n  + [Plots for Sale In Borivali West](https://www.addressofchoice.com/mumbai/borivali-west/plots-lpt6l1493)\n/* DLH Kesley\n\n## DLH Kesley\n\n[![location](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/navigate-outline.svg)Borivali West](https://www.addressofchoice.com/property-in-borivali-west-mumbai-l1493) [![Developer](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/business-outline.svg) By: Dev Land Housing](https://www.addressofchoice.com/property-in-dev-land-housing-d4796)\n\n![Location](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/location-outline.svg)Aayapa temple, 1-B, Ram Nagar Rd, Leela petroleum, Borivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400092.\n\n[![Google](https://www.google.com/favicon.ico) Add As A Preferred  \nSource On Google](https://www.google.com/preferences/source?q=Addressofchoice.com)\n\n[![Save](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/heart-outline.svg)Save](#) [![Review](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/chatbox-outline.svg) Post A Review](#rating)\n\nPrice Range Starting from\n\n###### 1.36 Cr to 4.15 Cr\\*\n\n![DLH Kesley](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/elevation/58267/1622049613_e1.png \"DLH Kesley\")\n\n# DLH Kesley in Borivali West, Mumbai Details | Reviews | Price | Floor Plan | Photos | Master Plan | Brochure | Amenities | Location\n\n![Floor Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/gallery-floor-plan.jpg \"Floor Plan\")\n\n![Site Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/gallery-site-plan.jpg \"Site Plan\")\n\n![DLH Kesley](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/elevation/58267/1622049613_e1.png \"DLH Kesley\")\n\n[![Save](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/heart-outline.svg)Save](#) [![Review](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/chatbox-outline.svg) Post A Review](#rating)\n\n#### Are you interested in property?\n\nGet attractive benefits with addressofchoice.com\n\n* [Highlights](#review)\n* [Overview](#overview)\n* [Units](#price_listWarpper)\n* [Specifications](#specifications)\n* [Locality & Price Trends](#locality)\n* [Related Projects](#Projects)\n* [Developers](#Developers)\n* [Review & Ratings](#rating)\n* [FAQs](#faqs)\n\n1 ,2 ,3 BHK Residential Property \n\nEMI Start at ₹\n\nStatus: **Ready to Move**\n\n[![call](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/call-outline.svg) CONTACT NOW](javascript:void(0)) [![home](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/conversation.svg) FAQ's](#faq_Property)\n\n* Apartment Sizes Ranges in Between 780 sqft - 1338 sqft.\n* Total Units & Towers: 95 Units & Towers\n* Total Project Area: Acres\n* Possession: March, 2019\n* Rera: P51800002310\n\n## About\n\nDlh Kesley is a remarkable Residential project located in the well-connected Borivali West locality of Mumbai. Spanning Details Available Upon Request, the project features 95 Units in Details Available Upon Request, offering a mix of 1 BHK+1T, to 3 BHK+3T Apartments ranging from 780 sqft to 1338 sqft. The address for the project is aayapa temple, 1-b, ram nagar rd, leela petroleum, borivali west, mumbai, maharashtra 400092..\n\n**Available Property Sizes**\n\nThe Apartments at Dlh Kesley are available in a variety of sizes. The 1 BHK+1T units start at 780 sqft. The larger 3 BHK+3T Apartments go up to 1338 sqft, providing ample space for families of all sizes.\n\n**Price Range**\n\nThe prices for the Apartments at Dlh Kesley are designed to be accessible, with 1 BHK+1T units priced from 1.36 Cr and 3 BHK+3T Apartments from 4.15 Cr, depending on the size and configuration.\n\n**Developer Information**\n\nThe project is being developed by Dev Land Housing, known for its commitment to quality and timely delivery. RERA registration number for the project is P51800002310 Units. Possession is expected to begin in 2019-03-06, ensuring that the property is well on track for future homeowners.\n\n**Amenities and Features**\n\nDlh Kesley is designed to offer a blend of luxury and convenience. Key sports amenities include a Sports Facility, Kids Play Area, Swimming Pool, Gym. For relaxation, the development offers a Lifts, Car Parking, Multipurpose Hall, Club house, Garden. The security features include CCTV for enhanced safety.\n\n**Construction and Specifications**\n\nThe project is constructed using premium materials such as vitrified tiles for flooring, granite countertops in the kitchens, and high-end sanitary ware in the bathrooms. These materials ensure both durability and elegance in every home.\n\n**Key Information**\n\n* Total Area: Details Available Upon Request\n* Units & Towers: 95 Units, Details Available Upon Request\n* Sizes: 780 sqft to 1338 sqft\n* Project Address: aayapa temple, 1-b, ram nagar rd, leela petroleum, borivali west, mumbai, maharashtra 400092.\n* Type: Residential Apartments\n* Developer: Dev Land Housing\n* RERA Registration No.: P51800002310 Units\n* Possession Start: 2019-03-06\n* Construction Quality: Premium materials, vitrified tiles, granite countertops\n* Security: CCTV\n* Sports Facilities: Sports Facility, Kids Play Area, Swimming Pool, Gym\n* Convenience Amenities: Lifts, Car Parking, Multipurpose Hall, Club house, Garden\n\n**Location Benefits**\n\nDlh Kesley benefits from its location in Borivali West, offering great connectivity to schools, hospitals, shopping malls, and public transport systems. This makes it an ideal place to live, especially for families.\n\n**Developer and Project Details**\n\nPossession at Dlh Kesley will begin in 2019-03-06, and the project is RERA registered under P51800002310 Units. Developed by Dev Land Housing, this project promises a reliable investment for prospective homeowners.\n\n### Sports Amenities\n\n* ![Sports Facility](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804694_sport-facility.svg) Sports Facility\n* ![Kids Play Area](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804595_kids-play-area.svg) Kids Play Area\n* ![Swimming Pool](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804565_swimming-pool.svg) Swimming Pool\n* ![Gym](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804743_gym.svg) Gym\n\n### Convenience Amenities\n\n* ![Lifts](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804644_lift.svg) Lifts\n* ![Car Parking](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804679_parking.svg) Car Parking\n* ![Multipurpose Hall](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804708_multipurpose-hall.svg) Multipurpose Hall\n* ![Club house](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804551_club-house.svg) Club house\n* ![garden](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804627_garden.svg) Garden\n\n### Safety Amenities\n\n* ![CCTV](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528887020_cctv.svg) CCTV\n\n## Floor Plans of DLH Kesley\n\n![DLH Kesley Floor Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/images/no-image.jpg \"DLH Kesley Floor Plan 437 sqft\")\n\n1 BHK (437 Sq. Ft.)\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n## EMI Calculator\n\nLoan Amount (80% of Total Cost) : 1.09 Cr\n\n## Rental Options Available!\n\nExplore rental flats in Godrej E-City\n\n [Check Rental Listings →](https://rental.addressofchoice.com/property-for-rent-in-dlh-kesley-borivali-west-mumbai-prop58267)\n\n## Bank Offers for DLH Kesley\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958784_sbi.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958779_icici.png \" \")